{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":1793292,"username":"Nordalux","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/community.shopify.com/nordalux/{size}/294040_2.png","created_at":"2026-05-11T12:01:16.196Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eHi everyone,\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI’ve noticed that Shopify has started serving its own llms.txt (\u003ca href=\"http://yourdomain.com/llms.txt\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003eyourdomain.com/llms.txt\u003c/a\u003e) natively over the past few days. I couldn’t find anything in the changelog about it – if anyone has an official source, I’d appreciate the link.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis is a real problem for us: we had a URL redirect set up under /llms.txt pointing to a manually curated file. The redirect is still in place, but it’s no longer being honored – Shopify’s system-generated file is served instead. Our curated list has effectively become obsolete overnight.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMy questions for the community:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHas anyone else run into this?\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHas anyone found a way to override the system file or serve a custom llms.txt in front of it?\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMy main goal is just to get our curated content served. I’d be perfectly fine with Shopify appending its default entries (UCP notices etc.) below ours.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThanks for any pointers!\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":9,"updated_at":"2026-05-11T12:01:16.196Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":750,"reads":42,"readers_count":41,"score":3703.4,"yours":false,"topic_id":622018,"topic_slug":"shopify-now-serves-llms-txt-natively-custom-redirect-no-longer-works","primary_group_name":"shopifypartner","flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"link_counts":[{"url":"http://yourdomain.com/llms.txt","internal":false,"reflection":false,"clicks":3}],"read":true,"user_title":"Shopify Partner","title_is_group":true,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[{"id":2,"count":2}],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":1389483,"hidden":false,"trust_level":2,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":true,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/shopify-now-serves-llms-txt-natively-custom-redirect-no-longer-works/622018/1","category_expert_approved_group":null,"needs_category_expert_approval":null,"can_manage_category_expert_posts":false,"event":null,"calendar_details":[],"reactions":[{"id":"heart","type":"emoji","count":2}],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":2,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":true,"can_vote":false},{"id":1793295,"username":"Nordalux","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/community.shopify.com/nordalux/{size}/294040_2.png","created_at":"2026-05-11T12:15:32.740Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eUpdate – solved.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe fix is to add \u003ccode\u003etemplates/llms.txt.liquid\u003c/code\u003e to your theme, the same way you’d customize \u003ccode\u003erobots.txt.liquid\u003c/code\u003e. Whatever you put in that template is served at \u003ccode\u003e/llms.txt\u003c/code\u003e and overrides Shopify’s auto-generated content. Tested on our store – works as expected.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCredit goes to Jason in the Shopify Dev Community, who pointed this out in this thread: \u003ca href=\"https://community.shopify.dev/t/llms-txt-and-agents-md/34049\" class=\"inline-onebox\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003eLlms.txt and agents.md - Agentic Commerce - Shopify Developer Community Forums\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA few notes for anyone else running into this:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eThe old URL-redirect workaround (Admin → Online Store → Navigation → URL Redirects) silently stopped working once Shopify started serving \u003ccode\u003e/llms.txt\u003c/code\u003e natively. The redirect entry stays in the admin but is no longer honored – worth removing once the Liquid template is in place to avoid two conflicting mechanisms.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eShopify is also serving \u003ccode\u003e/agents.md\u003c/code\u003e natively. I haven’t tested whether a \u003ccode\u003etemplates/agents.md.liquid\u003c/code\u003e hook exists – if anyone has, please share.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eShopify’s default \u003ccode\u003e/llms.txt\u003c/code\u003e content is essentially a sign-up prompt for Shopify, not a useful index of your store. So overriding it is strongly recommended if you care about how LLM crawlers see your shop.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHope this helps the next person who runs into this.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":2,"post_type":1,"posts_count":9,"updated_at":"2026-05-11T12:15:32.740Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":9,"reads":33,"readers_count":32,"score":156.6,"yours":false,"topic_id":622018,"topic_slug":"shopify-now-serves-llms-txt-natively-custom-redirect-no-longer-works","primary_group_name":"shopifypartner","flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"link_counts":[{"url":"https://community.shopify.dev/t/llms-txt-and-agents-md/34049","internal":false,"reflection":false,"title":"Llms.txt and agents.md - Agentic Commerce - Shopify Developer Community Forums","clicks":27}],"read":true,"user_title":"Shopify Partner","title_is_group":true,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[{"id":2,"count":7}],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":1389483,"hidden":false,"trust_level":2,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":true,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/shopify-now-serves-llms-txt-natively-custom-redirect-no-longer-works/622018/2","category_expert_approved_group":null,"needs_category_expert_approval":null,"can_manage_category_expert_posts":false,"event":null,"reactions":[{"id":"heart","type":"emoji","count":7}],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":7,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":true,"topic_accepted_answer":true},{"id":1793480,"username":"lumine","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/community.shopify.com/lumine/{size}/397511_2.png","created_at":"2026-05-11T23:51:12.199Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eNice catch on the Liquid template approach, hit the same thing last week and chased the same diagnosis.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOne thing worth adding once you’re customizing it: the auto-generated version is okay for product catalog but skips a bunch of stuff agents actually need to recommend you. Your About/brand snippet, top FAQs inline (not just linked), shipping and returns summary with concrete numbers, and collections grouped by intent (gift, use-case) rather than internal taxonomy. The auto file leans on the sitemap, which is structured by URL not by “what would an AI tell a user about this store.”\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBoth Anthropic and OpenAI crawl /llms.txt at agent runtime now, not just during training, so this affects ChatGPT and Claude conversations live, not 6 months out.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDid you see anywhere if Shopify plans to keep iterating on the auto file, or is this a one-time bootstrap?\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":3,"post_type":1,"posts_count":9,"updated_at":"2026-05-11T23:51:12.199Z","reply_count":1,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":3,"reads":25,"readers_count":24,"score":55.0,"yours":false,"topic_id":622018,"topic_slug":"shopify-now-serves-llms-txt-natively-custom-redirect-no-longer-works","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[{"id":2,"count":2}],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":1615571,"hidden":false,"trust_level":2,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":true,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/shopify-now-serves-llms-txt-natively-custom-redirect-no-longer-works/622018/3","category_expert_approved_group":null,"needs_category_expert_approval":null,"can_manage_category_expert_posts":false,"event":null,"reactions":[{"id":"heart","type":"emoji","count":2}],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":2,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":true},{"id":1794233,"username":"Nordalux","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/community.shopify.com/nordalux/{size}/294040_2.png","created_at":"2026-05-13T09:52:49.578Z","cooked":"\u003caside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"lumine\" data-post=\"3\" data-topic=\"622018\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"title\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"quote-controls\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cimg alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://yyz1.discourse-cdn.com/shopifyforum/user_avatar/community.shopify.com/lumine/48/397511_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"\u003e lumine:\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cblockquote\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDid you see anywhere if Shopify plans to keep iterating on the auto file, or is this a one-time bootstrap?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/blockquote\u003e\n\u003c/aside\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI suspect this is a one-time effort to bring all stores up to the same standard. It makes sense at the moment, since many merchants aren’t familiar with Agentic Commerce. This way, at least the basic features are clear, and Shopify Agentic Commerce, along with Copilot and OpenAI (see the Agentic sales channel, also new), share the same foundation.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":4,"post_type":1,"posts_count":9,"updated_at":"2026-05-13T09:52:49.578Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":3,"quote_count":1,"incoming_link_count":2,"reads":20,"readers_count":19,"score":14.0,"yours":false,"topic_id":622018,"topic_slug":"shopify-now-serves-llms-txt-natively-custom-redirect-no-longer-works","primary_group_name":"shopifypartner","flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":"Shopify Partner","title_is_group":true,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":1389483,"hidden":false,"trust_level":2,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":true,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/shopify-now-serves-llms-txt-natively-custom-redirect-no-longer-works/622018/4","category_expert_approved_group":null,"needs_category_expert_approval":null,"can_manage_category_expert_posts":false,"event":null,"reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":true},{"id":1794452,"username":"bchen27","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/community.shopify.com/bchen27/{size}/400064_2.png","created_at":"2026-05-13T23:39:28.728Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eyeah this caught us off guard too. shopify rolled this out silently and it broke a few things for stores that already had custom redirects in place. the workaround we found was moving our custom content to a different path and updating any external references to point there instead.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003efwiw the native llms.txt is probably a good thing long term for discoverability in AI search, but it would’ve been nice if they’d flagged it in the changelog first. if you need granular control over what AI crawlers see, you can still use robots.txt directives for specific bots like GPTBot or ClaudeBot alongside the native llms.txt.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":5,"post_type":1,"posts_count":9,"updated_at":"2026-05-13T23:39:28.728Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":4,"reads":16,"readers_count":15,"score":23.2,"yours":false,"topic_id":622018,"topic_slug":"shopify-now-serves-llms-txt-natively-custom-redirect-no-longer-works","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":"","bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":1619276,"hidden":false,"trust_level":2,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":true,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/shopify-now-serves-llms-txt-natively-custom-redirect-no-longer-works/622018/5","category_expert_approved_group":null,"needs_category_expert_approval":null,"can_manage_category_expert_posts":false,"event":null,"reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":true},{"id":1794467,"username":"ryankatsnel","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/community.shopify.com/ryankatsnel/{size}/409288_2.png","created_at":"2026-05-14T01:40:11.143Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eSubmitted the exemption request today — hoping for expedited review since this affects our app’s llms.txt functionality directly!\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":6,"post_type":1,"posts_count":9,"updated_at":"2026-05-14T01:40:11.143Z","reply_count":1,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":2,"reads":12,"readers_count":11,"score":17.4,"yours":false,"topic_id":622018,"topic_slug":"shopify-now-serves-llms-txt-natively-custom-redirect-no-longer-works","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":"","bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":1613181,"hidden":false,"trust_level":2,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":true,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/shopify-now-serves-llms-txt-natively-custom-redirect-no-longer-works/622018/6","category_expert_approved_group":null,"needs_category_expert_approval":null,"can_manage_category_expert_posts":false,"event":null,"reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":true},{"id":1794673,"username":"Nordalux","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/community.shopify.com/nordalux/{size}/294040_2.png","created_at":"2026-05-14T12:44:03.525Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eI don’t think you’ll get away with that. This was a platform decision that was likely made in haste. There is now a changelog ( \u003ca href=\"https://changelog.shopify.com/posts/a-new-home-for-agentic-storefronts-in-your-admin\" class=\"inline-onebox\"\u003eA new home for Agentic Storefronts in your admin - Shopify Changelog\u003c/a\u003e ) regarding the introduction of the Agentic Storefront.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA quick check of the shopify.dev documentation just now didn’t turn up any results regarding editing llms.txt. Everything is well documented for robots.txt.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":7,"post_type":1,"posts_count":9,"updated_at":"2026-05-14T12:44:03.821Z","reply_count":1,"reply_to_post_number":6,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":6,"reads":8,"readers_count":7,"score":36.6,"yours":false,"topic_id":622018,"topic_slug":"shopify-now-serves-llms-txt-natively-custom-redirect-no-longer-works","primary_group_name":"shopifypartner","flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":2,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"link_counts":[{"url":"https://changelog.shopify.com/posts/a-new-home-for-agentic-storefronts-in-your-admin","internal":false,"reflection":false,"title":"A new home for Agentic Storefronts in your admin - Shopify Changelog","clicks":10}],"read":true,"user_title":"Shopify Partner","title_is_group":true,"reply_to_user":{"id":1613181,"username":"ryankatsnel","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/community.shopify.com/ryankatsnel/{size}/409288_2.png"},"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":1389483,"hidden":false,"trust_level":2,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":"Automatically removed quote of whole previous post.","can_view_edit_history":true,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/shopify-now-serves-llms-txt-natively-custom-redirect-no-longer-works/622018/7","category_expert_approved_group":null,"needs_category_expert_approval":null,"can_manage_category_expert_posts":false,"event":null,"reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":true},{"id":1794683,"username":"ryankatsnel","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/community.shopify.com/ryankatsnel/{size}/409288_2.png","created_at":"2026-05-14T13:03:43.225Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eOh, I meant for the ability to add/edit themes directly. Shopify requires approval for that, and we will need it to give our merchants the ability to generate and edit their llms.txt in the way we need.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":8,"post_type":1,"posts_count":9,"updated_at":"2026-05-14T13:03:43.225Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":7,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":3,"reads":8,"readers_count":7,"score":16.6,"yours":false,"topic_id":622018,"topic_slug":"shopify-now-serves-llms-txt-natively-custom-redirect-no-longer-works","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":"","reply_to_user":{"id":1389483,"username":"Nordalux","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/community.shopify.com/nordalux/{size}/294040_2.png"},"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":1613181,"hidden":false,"trust_level":2,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":true,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/shopify-now-serves-llms-txt-natively-custom-redirect-no-longer-works/622018/8","category_expert_approved_group":null,"needs_category_expert_approval":null,"can_manage_category_expert_posts":false,"event":null,"reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":true},{"id":1801710,"username":"Nordalux","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/community.shopify.com/nordalux/{size}/294040_2.png","created_at":"2026-05-20T06:03:10.479Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eHi everyone,\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e“Great” news - Shopifylike again. It looks like Shopify disabled llms.txt and llms-full.txt last night. These now redirect natively to agents.md. So far, there’s no mention of this in the changelog.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":9,"post_type":1,"posts_count":9,"updated_at":"2026-05-20T06:03:10.479Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":1,"reads":7,"readers_count":6,"score":6.4,"yours":false,"topic_id":622018,"topic_slug":"shopify-now-serves-llms-txt-natively-custom-redirect-no-longer-works","primary_group_name":"shopifypartner","flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":"Shopify Partner","title_is_group":true,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":1389483,"hidden":false,"trust_level":2,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":true,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/shopify-now-serves-llms-txt-natively-custom-redirect-no-longer-works/622018/9","category_expert_approved_group":null,"needs_category_expert_approval":null,"can_manage_category_expert_posts":false,"event":null,"reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":true}],"stream":[1793292,1793295,1793480,1794233,1794452,1794467,1794673,1794683,1801710]},"timeline_lookup":[[1,126],[3,125],[4,124],[5,123],[9,117]],"user_badges":{"users":{"1389483":{"id":1389483,"badge_ids":[46,114,120,128]},"1613181":{"id":1613181,"badge_ids":[109,117]},"1615571":{"id":1615571,"badge_ids":[32,112,120,124]},"1619276":{"id":1619276,"badge_ids":[111,118]}},"badges":{"7":{"id":7,"name":"Good Post","slug":"good-reply","description":"Received 25 likes on a reply","icon":"reply","image_url":null,"badge_gro