\n\n\nGPTBot (ChatGPT \u0026hellip;","visible":true,"closed":false,"archived":false,"bookmarked":null,"liked":null,"tags":[{"id":4021,"name":"troubleshooting","slug":"troubleshooting"},{"id":4770,"name":"shop-performance","slug":"shop-performance"}],"tags_descriptions":{},"like_count":3,"views":641,"category_id":95,"featured_link":null,"op_like_count":3,"has_accepted_answer":false,"posters":[{"extras":null,"description":"Original Poster","user":{"id":252618,"username":"ella1234","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/e/e47774/{size}.png","primary_group_name":"merchant","trust_level":1}},{"extras":null,"description":"Recent Poster","user":{"id":1571988,"username":"clickfromai","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/community.shopify.com/clickfromai/{size}/356238_2.png","primary_group_name":"shopifypartner","trust_level":2}},{"extras":"latest","description":"Most Recent Poster","user":{"id":1449734,"username":"treschicp","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/t/c89c15/{size}.png","primary_group_name":"shopifystaff","trust_level":1}}]},{"fancy_title":"Feature request: Ondersteuning voor llms.txt (AI-crawlers beheren)","id":422221,"title":"Feature request: Ondersteuning voor llms.txt (AI-crawlers beheren)","slug":"feature-request-ondersteuning-voor-llms-txt-ai-crawlers-beheren","posts_count":1,"reply_count":0,"highest_post_number":0,"image_url":null,"created_at":"2025-07-04T10:29:42.000Z","last_posted_at":"2025-07-04T10:29:42.000Z","bumped":false,"bumped_at":"2025-07-04T10:29:42.000Z","archetype":"regular","unseen":false,"pinned":false,"unpinned":null,"excerpt":"Hallo Shopify-team en mede-winkeliers, \nIk wil graag een functie aanvragen die steeds belangrijker wordt: ondersteuning voor het llms.txt bestand. \nDit bestand werkt net als robots.txt, maar is bedoeld voor AI-crawlers z\u0026hellip;","visible":true,"closed":false,"archived":false,"bookmarked":null,"liked":null,"tags":[],"tags_descriptions":{},"like_count":0,"views":294,"category_id":72,"featured_link":null,"op_like_count":0,"has_accepted_answer":false,"posters":[{"extras":"latest single","description":"Original Poster, Most Recent Poster","user":{"id":252618,"username":"ella1234","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/e/e47774/{size}.png","primary_group_name":"merchant","trust_level":1}}]},{"fancy_title":"Llms.txt: a beginner\u0026rsquo;s guide for Shopify merchants","id":615651,"title":"Llms.txt: a beginner's guide for Shopify merchants","slug":"llms-txt-a-beginners-guide-for-shopify-merchants","posts_count":3,"reply_count":2,"highest_post_number":5,"image_url":null,"created_at":"2026-05-02T12:41:35.605Z","last_posted_at":"2026-05-05T15:25:30.929Z","bumped":true,"bumped_at":"2026-05-05T15:25:30.929Z","archetype":"regular","unseen":false,"pinned":false,"unpinned":null,"excerpt":"If you have run Shopify’s readiness scanner or read anything about AI visibility recently, you have probably seen the term llms.txt mentioned as something your store is missing. This post explains what it actually is, wh\u0026hellip;","visible":true,"closed":false,"archived":false,"bookmarked":null,"liked":null,"tags":[],"tags_descriptions":{},"like_count":7,"views":669,"category_id":308,"featured_link":null,"op_like_count":2,"has_accepted_answer":false,"posters":[{"extras":"latest","description":"Original Poster, Most Recent Poster","user":{"id":1074764,"username":"Rahul-FoundGPT","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/community.shopify.com/rahul-foundgpt/{size}/391458_2.png","primary_group_name":"shopifypartner","trust_level":2}},{"extras":null,"description":"Recent Poster","user":{"id":1615571,"username":"lumine","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/community.shopify.com/lumine/{size}/397511_2.png","trust_level":2}}]},{"fancy_title":"Llm.txt sitemap","id":622407,"title":"Llm.txt sitemap","slug":"llm-txt-sitemap","posts_count":3,"reply_count":0,"highest_post_number":3,"image_url":null,"created_at":"2026-05-13T00:56:50.604Z","last_posted_at":"2026-06-28T15:50:00.254Z","bumped":true,"bumped_at":"2026-06-28T15:50:00.254Z","archetype":"regular","unseen":false,"pinned":false,"unpinned":null,"excerpt":"Does Shopify recommend and support creating a llm.txt file for better AEO visibility and if yes, will Shopify be creating one for all stores as it does with sitemap.xml?","visible":true,"closed":false,"archived":false,"bookmarked":null,"liked":null,"tags":[],"tags_descriptions":{},"like_count":0,"views":428,"category_id":326,"featured_link":null,"op_like_count":0,"has_accepted_answer":false,"posters":[{"extras":null,"description":"Original Poster","user":{"id":36057,"username":"Kerri_Bennett","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/k/ce73a5/{size}.png","primary_group_name":"shopifypartner","trust_level":2}},{"extras":null,"description":"Recent Poster","user":{"id":1549387,"username":"PieLab","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/community.shopify.com/pielab/{size}/354492_2.png","primary_group_name":"shopifypartner","trust_level":2}},{"extras":"latest","description":"Most Recent Poster","user":{"id":1591736,"username":"margareta.petrovic","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/community.shopify.com/margareta.petrovic/{size}/406373_2.png","trust_level":1}}]}],"summarizable":true,"has_cached_summary":true,"ai_summary":{"id":1782458,"summarized_text":"Shopify recently began serving `/llms.txt` natively, which caused existing Admin URL redirects for `/llms.txt` to stop working without warning. The original workaround was resolved by adding a theme file at `templates/llms.txt.liquid`, similar to `robots.txt.liquid`; content placed there overrides Shopify’s auto-generated `/llms.txt` output.\n\nParticipants noted that Shopify’s default file appears more like a generic Agentic Commerce/signup prompt than a curated store index, so merchants wanting control over how AI/LLM crawlers interpret their store may prefer a custom Liquid template. One app developer is seeking Shopify approval to edit themes directly so their app can generate or manage merchants’ `llms.txt` files.\n\nA later update changes the situation again: Shopify appears to have disabled both `/llms.txt` and `/llms-full.txt`, with those paths now redirecting natively to `/agents.md`. No changelog entry was found for this latest change, leaving the current override behavior and long-term support for custom `llms.txt` unresolved.","algorithm":"gpt-5.5","outdated":false,"created_at":"2026-09-11T23:29:54.173Z","updated_at":"2026-09-11T23:29:54.173Z"},"is_category_expert_question":null,"has_livestream":null,"valid_reactions":["heart","+1","laughing","open_mouth","clap","confetti_ball","hugs"],"accepted_answers":[{"id":1793295,"username":"Nordalux","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/community.shopify.com/nordalux/{size}/294040_2.png","created_at":"2026-05-11T12:15:32.740Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eUpdate – solved.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe fix is to add \u003ccode\u003etemplates/llms.txt.liquid\u003c/code\u003e to your theme, the same way you’d customize \u003ccode\u003erobots.txt.liquid\u003c/code\u003e. Whatever you put in that template is served at \u003ccode\u003e/llms.txt\u003c/code\u003e and overrides Shopify’s auto-generated content. Tested on our store – works as expected.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCredit goes to Jason in the Shopify Dev Community, who pointed this out in this thread: \u003ca href=\"https://community.shopify.dev/t/llms-txt-and-agents-md/34049\" class=\"inline-onebox\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003eLlms.txt and agents.md - Agentic Commerce - Shopify Developer Community Forums\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA few notes for anyone else running into this:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eThe old URL-redirect workaround (Admin → Online Store → Navigation → URL Redirects) silently stopped working once Shopify started serving \u003ccode\u003e/llms.txt\u003c/code\u003e natively. The redirect entry stays in the admin but is no longer honored – worth removing once the Liquid template is in place to avoid two conflicting mechanisms.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eShopify is also serving \u003ccode\u003e/agents.md\u003c/code\u003e natively. I haven’t tested whether a \u003ccode\u003etemplates/agents.md.liquid\u003c/code\u003e hook exists – if anyone has, please share.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eShopify’s default \u003ccode\u003e/llms.txt\u003c/code\u003e content is essentially a sign-up prompt for Shopify, not a useful index of your store. So overriding it is strongly recommended if you care about how LLM crawlers see your shop.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHope this helps the next person who runs into this.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":2,"topic_id":622018,"url":"/t/shopify-now-serves-llms-txt-natively-custom-redirect-no-longer-works/622018/2"}],"has_accepted_answer":true,"shared_issue_count":0,"can_create_shared_issue":false,"shared_issue_visible":true,"can_vote":false,"vote_count":0,"user_voted":false,"discourse_zendesk_plugin_zendesk_id":null,"discourse_zendesk_plugin_zendesk_url":"https://your-url.zendesk.com/agent/tickets/","details":{"can_edit":false,"notification_level":1,"participants":[{"id":1389483,"username":"Nordalux","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/community.shopify.com/nordalux/{size}/294040_2.png","post_count":5,"primary_group_name":"shopifypartner","flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"trust_level":2},{"id":1613181,"username":"ryankatsnel","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/community.shopify.com/ryankatsnel/{size}/409288_2.png","post_count":2,"primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"trust_level":2},{"id":1615571,"username":"lumine","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/community.shopify.com/lumine/{size}/397511_2.png","post_count":1,"primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"trust_le